    },
    "Pipeline Publica": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "WA Publicado Agendado", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": true
  },
  "_comment": "VARIAVEIS DE AMBIENTE necessarias no n8n: PIPELINE_SERVICE_API_KEY, OUTBOUND_WEBHOOK_SECRET (opcional), WHATSAPP_API_URL, WHATSAPP_API_KEY, WHATSAPP_INSTANCE, CLIENT_WHATSAPP_NUMBER. Configure OUTBOUND_WEBHOOK_URL no Coolify com a URL do Webhook deste workflow."
}
